{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320826001:1":{"text":"ん？彫刻刀が足りないぞ。斜刀（しゃとう）はどこだ？","source_cn":"奇怪，这里的雕刻刀不是整套，斜刀缺失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDACFB5F27FA59969","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320826002:1":{"text":"他の所に置いてあるとか？","source_cn":"被工匠放在别的地方了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DE631D94CE22DFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320826003:1":{"text":"彫刻刀は職人の手の延長みたいなもんだ、それを適当に置くなんてあり得ん！","source_cn":"刻刀对于雕刻匠人来说，就如同自己手臂的延伸，怎么能随手乱放！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD9B431FDEA10303","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320826004:1":{"text":"お前さんたちは自分の手足を外して、その辺に放ったりするか？それにあの斜刀には、ダニカっていう立派な名前だってあるんだ！","source_cn":"你们会把自己的手臂或者腿脚拆下来放到别处去吗？何况她有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07726B0D82BE90D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1320826004":{"text":"お前さんたちは自分の手足を外して、その辺に放ったりするか？それにあの斜刀には、ダニカっていう立派な名前だってあるんだ！","source_cn":"你们会把自己的手臂或者腿脚拆下来放到别处去吗？何况她有自己的名字，叫丹妮卡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07726B0D82BE90D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","documen